This file is intentionally NOT a structurally valid PDF.

It is a synthetic fixture for Proofline's deterministic HUMAN REVIEW smoke
test. The existing pipeline (inspectPdf -> verifyPdfAgainstPageLimit ->
verifyPdfPageLimitWithEvidence -> readinessFindingFromEvidence ->
buildReadinessResult) classifies an unparseable PDF as evidence
'unsupported' (page count unknown), which the readiness layer promotes to a
'needs_review' finding and therefore an overall 'human_review' status.

No real manuscript content is required for this fixture.
